{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510180","name":"法尔伽【彩蛋】","desc":"法尔伽彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/2f72444a2e08c7b93748e43654f62dd7_3071010008720168439.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e西风骑士团大团长，守护蒙德的北风骑士。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/520ce98cab494015bb50e5093cae9182_8378953146088672743.png\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"角色名\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e法尔伽\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"生日\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e2月17日\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"所属\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e西风骑士团\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/ef7f4f191609e873836ae2096d9075b8_7744738913793674586.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"s7e3e8ihh2T1772465815708\",\"child_ids\":{\"s7e3e8ihh2T1772465815708\":[]},\"contents\":{\"0xt2xf8mkoggT1773032809611\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：毕竟菲林斯是…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"2pm8kg6f7h1T1773032918161\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：干杯！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：干杯！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：祝各位，今夜愉快。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"40ffnnq102sT1773032612281\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：请吧。小姐/先生，这是一杯无名的饮料，但我相信，它会为你带来好心情。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：派蒙小姐，这杯鲜榨的果汁是你的，我在里面掺了一些果肉，喝起来口感会更好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：哇！谢谢，嘿嘿嘿——\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：法尔伽先生，请你尝尝这一杯。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：噢？还有我的份，这是酒会之后的解酒环节吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：这是…钩钩果的味道，哈哈哈哈哈，你从哪里搞来的，什么时候？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：你对蒙德城的思念溢于言表，而我又恰好善于捕捉细节。总之，我相信这种果子能让你愉快一些。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：真不错。可惜啊…整个挪德卡莱，也只有你能和我喝这么久。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：不过，你似乎从来都没有喝尽兴过。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：如果你是指，完全陶醉在美酒之中，任凭思绪缥缈，享受此类捉摸不透的快感。那么我想…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4jeahvj5rn8T1773032812154\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：消失无踪。虽然有些烈酒会让火苗腾起，但老实说，我对此并无太大感觉。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：哈，那只不过是酒不够烈！比如至冬的「火水」，你肯定尝过，对吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：当然。但我很久没喝过了，都快忘了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：过段时间我去搞一桶，咱们喝个痛快。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：听您的，法尔伽先生。但在那之前，我想咱们应当一起碰个杯，来庆祝今晚美好的相遇。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：好嘞，干杯！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"itlm7v54amT1773032285552\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：酸一些。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：看你的脸色有些疲惫。来点酸味提提神，的确不错。嗯…不如来一些柠檬汁吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：我还没尝过酸味的酒呢，最多是在喝完酒之后，再来一点酸的饮料来解酒。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：这么一说，好久没有尝过诺艾尔做的解酒汤了，她就会在里面放钩钩果和树莓汁。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：唉，没了诺艾尔的解酒汤，我的酒量都下降了不少，真想回蒙德啊…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"s7e3e8ihh2T1772465815708\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"tff11h17dT1773032810760\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：酒遇见火就会…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z2d5m71yb59T1773032284939\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：甜一些。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：嗯，奔波忙碌了一天，的确需要用甜味来犒劳自己，我想，奶油应当合你的心意。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：甜的？噢，不然加点我们上次喝的果汁？味道很不错，甜味也很适中。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：法尔伽先生，我想我们喝酒时，从未喝过「果汁」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e菲林斯：我猜，你说的应该是那一瓶从稻妻进口的「绯樱酒」吧，那一小瓶，可是放倒了四个酒客。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e法尔伽：「绯樱酒」？怪了，我喝的时候都没尝出什么味道，只记得那一碟「盐渍绯樱」味道很不错，适合下酒。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"彩蛋·庆典！砰砰大行动","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\"\u003e庆典！砰砰大行动\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e2026.03.20\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"200\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs